    "The display can still turn off. Watch viewing releases the hold within about 12 seconds after polling stops.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The display can still turn off. Watch viewing releases the hold within about 12 seconds after polling stops."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La pantalla puede apagarse. El Watch libera el bloqueo de reposo unos 12 s después de dejar de consultar."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A tela ainda pode apagar. O Watch libera o bloqueio de repouso em cerca de 12 s após parar as consultas."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "屏幕仍可关闭。Watch 停止轮询后，约 12 秒内会解除防休眠状态。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The draft is too long for a browser link. Shorten it and attach the saved diagnostic file on GitHub.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The draft is too long for a browser link. Shorten it and attach the saved diagnostic file on GitHub."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "El borrador es demasiado largo para un enlace. Acórtalo y adjunta el diagnóstico guardado en GitHub."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "O rascunho é longo demais para um link. Reduza o texto e anexe o diagnóstico salvo no GitHub."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "草稿过长，无法放入浏览器链接。请缩短内容，并在 GitHub 上附加已保存的诊断文件。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The four steps from the first launch: agent hooks, chat and notices, other screens, and a list of what XTermX does. Nothing changes unless you change it there.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The four steps from the first launch: agent hooks, chat and notices, other screens, and a list of what XTermX does. Nothing changes unless you change it there."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Los cuatro pasos iniciales: hooks, conversación y avisos, otras pantallas y funciones de XTermX. Nada cambia sin tu elección."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Os quatro passos iniciais: hooks, conversa e avisos, outras telas e recursos do XTermX. Nada muda sem você escolher."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "重新查看首次启动的四个步骤：智能体钩子、聊天与通知、其他屏幕，以及 XTermX 功能。只有你主动更改的选项才会生效。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The pairing code includes the available routes. Devices try them in order.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
