    "These rules apply to remote app actions. Another terminal that allows control still grants shell access on this Mac.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "These rules apply to remote app actions. Another terminal that allows control still grants shell access on this Mac."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Las reglas se aplican a acciones de la app remota. Otro terminal con control sigue dando acceso al shell del Mac."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "As regras valem para ações do app remoto. Outro terminal com controle ainda dá acesso ao shell deste Mac."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这些规则限制远程应用操作。如果另一个终端允许控制，设备仍可通过其访问此 Mac 的 shell。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "These shortcuts stay fixed so terminal controls and macOS editing keep their usual behavior.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "These shortcuts stay fixed so terminal controls and macOS editing keep their usual behavior."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Estos atajos son fijos para preservar los controles del terminal y la edición de macOS."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Estes atalhos são fixos para preservar os controles do terminal e a edição do macOS."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这些快捷键保持固定，以保留终端控制和 macOS 编辑的常规行为。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "These switches govern remote app actions. A device that can type in a shell can still run shell commands.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "These switches govern remote app actions. A device that can type in a shell can still run shell commands."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Las opciones controlan acciones de la app remota. Un dispositivo que escribe en el shell puede seguir ejecutando comandos."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "As chaves controlam ações do app remoto. Um aparelho que pode digitar no shell ainda pode executar comandos."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这些开关控制远程应用操作。可以在 shell 中输入的设备仍然可以运行 shell 命令。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
